  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0\n- Add support for ar, de, es, fr, it, ja, ru, zh languages.\nv2.1.0\n- Add EntityNotFound.ForId<TEntity>().\nv2.0.0\n- Add .NET 10.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 9.0 targets. (BREAKING)\nv1.0.0\n- Add .NET 9.0 target.\n- Drop .NET 5.0, NET6.0, NET7.0 targets. (BREAKING)\n- Drop binary serialization on exceptions. (BREAKING)\nv0.3.1\n- Extend ConcurrencyIssue factory method with innerException overload.\nv0.3.0\n- Support .NET 7.0. #62\nv0.2.1\n- Nullable anotations. #48\nv0.1.0\n- Qowaiv.Validation.Abstractions dependency\nv0.0.2\n- AccessDenied (#30)\nv0.0.1\n- AccessDenied (#22)\n- ConcurrencyIssue (#22)\n- EntityNotFound (#22)",
